  "details": "When making a world, VRChat automatically sets up your project's layers to match VRChat's. I propose adding a simple button that also adds this for avatars.\n\nThe reason for this is because particle systems have to be aware of these layers to collide correctly. Currently you have to add a scene descriptor temporarily, but that can get tedious for a lot of projects.",
